# "level" with no level is noise. The template's segment is dropped whole
# rather than rendering "Documents, tree item, level ,".
#
# The old string-tidying pass collapsed doubled separators after the fact and
# could not catch this one, because "level " is not an empty segment — it is a
# label that lost its value.

node t1 TreeItem "Documents" level=2 pos=3 size=8
node t2 TreeItem "Pictures"
focus t1
drain
focus t2

expect
  Documents, tree item, level 2, 3 of 8
  Pictures, tree item
